{"server":"tw","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_08_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_08","title":"種因","storyCode":"HS-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"52cc6fc1d87976d7a3edebf860dbb8a1370fde29b405edb63075b29d697e729f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗無天日。\n不知地深幾許，沒有半點陽光透進來，空氣也凝重得彷彿能感受到穹頂的重量。\n這是一座陵墓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況……我回這來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老東西，還活著嗎？我來看看你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（喑啞的嘶吼）"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前是一扇厚重的大門，聲音是從門後傳來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睡了這麼久，火氣是半點都沒少啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別裝模作樣嚇唬人了，在這裡躺了這麼長時間，你真的還剩下什麼能耐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好怕的……吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是哪座山頭，怎麼連塊路牌都沒有……不對，這是哪一年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這路上兩邊的房子，像是沒有移動地塊的樣子……怎麼像是我剛來尚蜀的時候？"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮——噹——\n一人正用繩子將自己懸在陡峭的山崖上，用一錘一鑿在懸壁上刻下一行行字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——山上那兄弟，你做什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不認識我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼要認識你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這整座尚蜀城都是在我的設計下建造出來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，厲害厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災就要來了，人都已經撤走了。但我建造的這些屋子，都要毀於這場天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靖炎五年，餘至尚蜀，歷三十載……《尚蜀城記》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把我建造這座城的過程全部刻在這山崖上，讓後世億兆百姓全部記得我的功績！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是天災馬上就要來了哎，就算你不惜命，一道天雷劈下來，這座山頭都不一定保得住，你這不是白費功夫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管不了那麼多了，我就只有這一個方法。要是沒人知道我的作為，我還不如不活了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有這樣的人……好吧，你接著忙，我就不打擾啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，山上這條路最後通到哪裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"懇請先生賜劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要劍，做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救人，報仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，我鑄的劍很貴的，你用什麼換？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我應該已經拒絕你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你記不記恨我，當年用一把破銅爛鐵就打發了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在說什麼，不過是個幻影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是您偏偏還記得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是惦記著電影劇本的原型故事……還是忍不住會想，要是當時真的送你一把好劍，故事結局會不會有什麼不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像您這樣神通廣大、見識無數的人，又怎會對我這樣的無名之輩抱有惻隱之心呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"區區一個人類的命，對您來說，確實太不值錢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能說得這麼過分吧，我還是很喜歡你們人類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看我們，就像在看戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的隨性之舉，就能為這齣戲添一處奇景，改變無數人的命運。到興起的時候，您甚至也想加入進來，唱上幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可戲裡風景千萬，唯獨您不在戲中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盲眼的少年劍客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您始終孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，看走馬燈這件事也能落到我的身上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"累了，這把劍是認真打的，你帶走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我看看，故事結局還有沒有什麼變數。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，有一個少年，託我一定在今年冬至日前，把這個包裹交給您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不敢親自來見我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他應該，已經死了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"包裹是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，在下恭候多時了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下有一事不解，請先生解惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來聽聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，今日我到城郊採風，見到河邊棲著一隻奇異的羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒看過那麼漂亮的羽獸……我正要掏出紙筆來畫，它卻振翅一飛，消失不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想憑記憶裡的印象去描繪它，卻無論如何畫不出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"力所不及的事，過去便過去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對其他人來說，過去也就過去了。可我姑且還自詡是個畫家……是畫家，總還是想留下點什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年來，也畫了不少。總覺得只有畫得夠多，見過的風景夠多，才算不枉這一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我終於想明白了一個道理……畫，到底是死物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時畫下的風景，下一瞬便是過眼雲煙。畫得越多，越覺得自己的畫微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是理所當然的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生年不滿百，想看遍這片大地只能是奢望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……先生應該還是沒有明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有在下一幅拙作，還想請先生指點一二。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們肉眼凡胎，凡夫俗子，所見風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是您這樣的先生，您所行所見的風景，比起這片大地千年間天翻地覆的變化，也不過是滄海一粟罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，再好好看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都只有這一夕的時間了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長得真好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是你種的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡的人們種的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你說的，我不能用我的能力來干涉這些莊稼的生長……總有一天我會消失不見的，但這裡的人們還要生活很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是辛苦你了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，黍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我那個弟弟也說，最近總會夢見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹嘛總是要惦記我呢……是不是人上了年紀，就容易懷念過去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也會開我玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在這裡的人，都記得曾經有一位“神農”，總結了二十四節氣，教給人們耕種的知識。還冒著生命危險，把萬頃凍土開墾成良田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“神農”，我怎麼擔得起呢。明明是我們一起做過的事，你怎麼好全推在我身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去這麼久了，還分什麼你我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只記得，在我像一個孩子一樣漫無目的地遊蕩的時候，有一個人把我留在了身邊，給了我一個“家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她告訴我，不必在意什麼人獸有別。我可以……我應該像一個人一樣活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我沒有想到，你還留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我答應過你的。守護好這片土地，讓更多的人能吃飽飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍啊……你怨過我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一千年了，哪裡談得上是奉獻呢？這明明是囚禁……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你已經神識散盡，還要因為與這片土地的連結被困在這裡，不得自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我犯下的一個錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會怨你……我只怨自己，最後沒有替你去那趟北邊的遠行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍……你知道的，與你認識這麼長時間，我從來沒有一刻把你當作“神”，我甚至都快忘了這一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可直到最後與你分別的時候，我才意識到，我是有私心的，作為“人”的私心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想懇求你留下來，繼續幫助這裡的人們。我的無數同族，他們都需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不確定，你會不會愛他們，就像對我一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕，我讓你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是失敗了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最後還是沒有找到種子，我也沒能研究出可以種在源石土壤上的莊稼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連這片土地，我們都沒能保護下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人定勝天……人甚麼時候真的勝過天呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍……你後悔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的這些，其實你早都知道的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本不該在這裡見到我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1242_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是殘留在這個裝置裡的一縷意識，我是這一點意識的回憶。罔兩問景，多麼悲哀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目模糊的女性","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇妙的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“自在”","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在你心裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命犯貪嗔，貪生怕死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都差點忘了，當時為什麼會畫你出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山高水遙無是處，無礙吾自在人間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"渾渾噩噩了許久，我竟然連這點清醒都丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說要畫遍世間萬物才算畫家，畫出一山一水，便是一山一水的境界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家揮劍，層山盡起。\n我即為我。\n我見即萬象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，醒醒？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"在片場睡過去，作為導演也太失職了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睏了就睡嘛……我們現在拍的是哪一部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"《機械巨獸大戰巨獸》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，這不是我壓箱底的劇本嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是指離譜程度嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我發誓，今年一定是最後一年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嬉笑怒罵，皆成文章，傳說志異，都是故事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，小炎熔啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你為什麼願意陪我鬧這麼久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你答應我的傳奇武器，什麼時候給我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然還是惦記這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是哪天，我消失得無影無蹤，再也找不到——你會想我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"真有那麼一天，不會有人記得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你造出來的武器，工具，城市，還有那些電影，全都會消失不見……你明知道這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得對……我也不該在這裡見到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，說得沒錯。我折騰的這些玩意，說到底都是白費功夫。可忍不住，就是要找點樂子，留點念想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西留過，我也開心過，這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你啊，小炎熔。在羅德島上有你陪著胡鬧的這些日子，還挺開心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丟臉……明明是自己造出來的東西，還要反過來教訓我一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動不動讓別人翻些無關緊要的記憶，實在是件很矯情的事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了吧，能從那團混沌中分出來，我們已經回答過那個問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一顆心臟而已，就別妄想再收我們回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老傢伙，我們辛辛苦苦從暗無天日的陵墓裡走出來，不是為了繼續活在你的陰影下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]}]}
